Alex: Yuuuuhhhhhh!
===

title: Alex_Introduction
---
<<met_player>>
Alex: ...? What do you want? It's rude to stare y'know.
 -> You look like you could use a little pick me up. Interested in some cheese?
    Alex: Hey, hey! Who do you think you're talkin' to like that? You're either stupid or... just stupid 
    sayin' something like that out in the open!
 -> Dang, who pissed in your cornflakes?
    Alex: Oh shut up... So can I help you or...?
    -> I'm looking for a rat named Tommy. I last saw him getting dragged around by a couple of rats.
      Alex: Can't say that I have. I remember there being some reports of a few kidnappings.
      Alex: Apparently some witnesses say they could see two almost identical rats as the perps.
      Alex: All I know though. Haven't seen anything personally, sorry.
      <<jump Alex_Anything_Else_1>>
    -> I'm new to the city. Any tips?
    -> Would you have any interest in some cheese?
      Alex: Bold of you to ask something like that so casually. But my answer is no.
      -> What? Why not?
         Alex: Word travels fast around here. It's like the damn walls have ears. Besides, got my own dealer already...
         -> You sure there's nothing I can do to convince you? Discounted price...?
            Alex: ...Listen, you seem really adamant, I see that. But you have to understand my apprehension.
            Alex: Maybe if you do me a favor? Then I might be able to help you out...
               -> Really? Alright, as long as it's not a ridiculous task...
                  <<jump Alex_Favor_1_Intro>>
               -> Sorry man, not worth it...
                  <<set_node Alex_Favor1_Change_Mind>>

===

title: Alex_Favor1_Change_Mind
---
Alex: ...Come back to help me?
-> Sure, what do you want me to do?
   <<jump Alex_Favor_1_Intro>>
-> Any updates on seeing Tommy?
   Alex: No, sorry...
-> No, nevermind...

