title: Alex_Anything_Else_1
---
Alex: Anything else?
   -> I'm new to the city, any tips?
      Alex: Hm... I'd say watch out for any officers or mafia enforcers.
      Alex: There's been an increase of them being sent here to patrol. They'll search you, 
      Alex: and literally find any reason to take what you have. Money, precious items, you name it.
   -> Would you have any interest in some cheese?
      <<jump Alex_Atempt_Sell_1>>
   -> No, thanks for your time.
      Alex: See you around.
