// FIRST FAVOR DIALOGUE
title: Alex_Favor_1_Intro
---
Alex: Alright, thanks in advance man!
Alex: Okay, so listen. I have this... Delivery I gotta make. Crate full of precious stuff.
Alex: Now don't go opening it, alright? It's not your business, and we gotta keep this discreet.
Alex: Now, there's this area near the casino... a hangout of sorts. Need ya to talk to talk to one of the rats there.
Alex: You can give them the crate. I kinda owe them quite a lot, so I'd rather save my face from getting punched and have a
Alex: delivery boy do it for me.
Alex: Oh! And I here there's someone patroling near there. Just try not to get caught with this crate, okay? Trust me, just don't.
   -> Yeesh, to scared to deliver this yourself? Alright, I'll do it. Just don't forget our agreement.
      Alex: Yeah, yeah, I won't. I'm counting on you!
      <<activate_favor>>
      <<set_node "Alex_Favor_1_Mid">>

===

title: Alex_Favor_1_Mid
---
Alex: Remember, look for some rats near the casino, okay?

===

title: Alex_Favor_1_Comp
---
Alex: You did it? Hell yeah! You have no idea how much trouble you saved me, heh!
<<update_trust>>
   -> Yeah, yeah, whatever. Remember our deal?
      <<activate_selling>>
      Alex: Oh sure, pal! Lemme see what you got. I like the strong stuff, y'know?
      Alex: Ooh, not bad, not bad... And you really don't get you're supply from the mafia? Impressive, man.
      Alex: Maybe I'll let you come by more often...
      <<set_node "Alex_1st_Full_Convo_Over">>

===

